{"c":[{"name":"20261005T044915Z-bf6a7f62ff27c59b","text":"B28: Ask scope words (planner/scope-words.ts) are allowlists: only FILLER may stand beside a whole-form or section phrase, and a source phrase must open with a preposition. Matching field labels in the rest failed open three times.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T060231Z-5982020e0a78f148","text":"B28: Ask trusts a whole-form or section scope only if the whole normalized instruction is a scope-words.ts grammar sentence, and a section only under one un-nested heading that is wholly the user's own. Searching inside after stripping sources/titles/quotes failed open 5 times.","type":"note"}]}
